CodeBreaker is a reverse-engineering toolkit. It contains no proprietary
binaries, game code, game assets or platform-SDK content: it operates only on
inputs that the user supplies, kept outside version control (binaries/, see
docs/NOT_IN_REPO.md). See DISCLAIMER in README.md.

Third-party open-source code in this repository, each under its own license:
