                               src/recompile/rexglue/kernel and src/recompile/rexglue/dxbc), with what they carry:
                               fmt (MIT), libmspack (LGPL-2.1), o1heap (MIT), SIMDe (MIT), utfcpp
                               (Boost 1.0), toml++ (MIT), disruptorplus (MIT, Lewis Baker),
